ge to the  citizens of this country to speak about  the spirit of Ukraine even in the midst  of these attacks against the power grid  here's more of what he had to say  will not break us to hear the enemy's  anthem on our land is scarier than the  enemy's rockets in our Sky we are not  afraid of Darkness the darkest times for  us are not the times without light but  those without will our military is  strong volunteers are tireless partners  are reliable and people are unbreakable  the second Army of the world will get  smaller and smaller there will be more  and more losses for the Army I'm sure  that hostile propaganda does not work  provocations do not work threats do not  scare any tough winter will not scare us  we know that the darkest night becomes  the dawn  Sammy the fact that you are having power  outages at this level in the capital of  the country clearly shows what a toll  those Russian strikes against the power  infrastructure are having on Ukraine and  yet you do encounter this resilience  from the citizens here people who say  they will try to continue with their  daily lives with their normal lives as  much as possible Sammy all right  Muhammad thanks for uh covering that for  us

